#, no-wrap
msgid "[IBM Quantum Learning](/learning) to take a course, explore teaching modules, and start experimenting with Composer (coming soon)\n"
msgstr "[IBM Quantum Learning](/learning) untuk mengikuti kursus, menjelajahi modul pengajaran, dan mulai bereksperimen dengan Composer (segera hadir)\n"

